WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
And if we had the most clean air, and I think we do,

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:03.840
we have very clean air.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.240
We have the cleanest air we've had in many, many years.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:11.040
But the problem is that other countries, like China,

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.400
which has air that's a little bit rough.

